        "ga2": {
          "visible": false
        },
        "gr": {
          "visible": false
        },
        "g2r": {
          "visible": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "short": "Recap",
      "title": "Recap",
      "chapter": "recap",
      "body": "• Give each client a **budget**; reject the excess early with **429**.\n• **Token buckets** allow short bursts and cap the average rate.\n• Across many gateways, keep counters in a **shared store**.\n• Layer limits: per **user**, per **tenant**, per endpoint.\n• Under global overload, **shed** low-priority work first.",
      "callout": {
        "kind": "tip",
        "text": "Next up: **Timeouts & Retries** — what to do when the service you’re calling is the one in trouble."
      },
      "changes": [],
